SUMMARY:! Shinkansen: Nozomi 308\, 06:39 → Tokyo 09:06\, res
 erved (booked)
DESCRIPTION:ARRIVE 09:06: Tokyo Station: walk to the Yaesu S
 outh bus terminal\, bus 09:50\nLEAVE 06:39. Nozomi 308\, 06:
 39 → Tokyo 09:06\, reserved (booked) (¥15930 each)\n\nSeats 
 are on the Klook ticket. Tokyo is the last stop (Shinagawa 0
 8:59 is the one before). Keep the QR/ticket for the exit gat
 e. Then walk to the JR Highway Bus Terminal at the Yaesu Sou
 th Exit for the 09:50 bus (check the boarding point on the b
 us voucher).\n\nROUTE: Tokaido Shinkansen Nozomi 308 (のぞみ308
 号) for 東京 Tokyo from Shin-Osaka\, 06:39\, to 東京 Tokyo\, 09:0
 6\, the last stop: do not get off at Shinagawa (08:59). Foll
 ow the 新幹線 signs and check the departure board for the platf
 orm. Booked 13 Nov: ₫15\,574\,419 for 6. The yen price is wo
 rked out from the dong price at ₫163 to the yen\, so it is a
 n estimate (the window fare is ¥14\,720). Tokyo is the last 
 stop\; Shinagawa (08:59) is the stop before\n\nSTEP BY STEP:
 \n- Ride: Tokaido Shinkansen Nozomi 308 (のぞみ308号)\, reserved
 \, booked: Shin-Osaka 06:39 → Tokyo 09:06 (last stop) (147 m
 in · ¥15\,930). Booked. Shinagawa 08:59 is the stop before: 
 do not get off there.\n- Walk: Shinkansen platform\, Tokyo →
  Yaesu South gate (八重洲南口) and the JR Highway Bus Terminal (5
 –10 min · ≈300–500 m) [estimate]. Planned 5-10 min. The JR t
 erminal is right outside the Yaesu South gate (several guide
 s). If the ticket says "Bus Terminal Tokyo Yaesu" (Tokyo Mid
 town Yaesu\, B1/B2)\, add about 5 min: turn right\, pass the
  JR terminal\, cross at the first signal.\n\nFull plan\, map
 s and live changes: https://japan-trip-app-wine.vercel.app/
LOCATION:Tokyo Station Yaesu South Exit
