BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-fri-kawaguchiko-1@jp-trip
SEQUENCE:21891
DTSTAMP:20261116T045100Z
DTSTART:20261120T005000Z
DTEND:20261120T025200Z
SUMMARY:! Bus: Fujikyu highway bus\, Tokyo Station 09:50 → K
 awaguchiko 11:52
DESCRIPTION:ARRIVE 11:52: Kawaguchiko Station: suitcases in 
 the coin lockers\nLEAVE 09:50. Fujikyu highway bus\, Tokyo S
 tation 09:50 → Kawaguchiko 11:52 (¥2300 each)\n\nTICKET (Klo
 ok): Fujikyu bus 09:50\, booked for 6. Show the Klook vouche
 r to the driver\; save a screenshot in case there is no sign
 al. Be at the stop by about 09:30. One suitcase each in the 
 hold (queue early). Arrive Kawaguchiko 11:52.\n\nROUTE: From
  the Shinkansen gates walk to the Yaesu South Exit (八重洲南口) a
 nd the JR Highway Bus Terminal next to it (confirm the board
 ing point on your ticket: the Tekko Building terminal is a d
 ifferent place). Fujikyu bus\, 09:50\, to 河口湖駅 Kawaguchiko S
 tation\, 11:52 (Fuji-Q Highland 11:40\, Mt Fuji Station 11:4
 7)\; it can run late on a long-weekend morning. Booked: ₫2\,
 248\,865 for 6 (¥2\,300 each). One suitcase each in the trun
 k\, which cannot be reserved: queue first. At Kawaguchiko\, 
 put the suitcases in the coin lockers at the station (large 
 lockers about ¥700\, est.): Fuga A only takes luggage from 1
 3:00. Red Line to Oishi Park at 12:15\, or 12:30 if the bus 
 is late\; if you are not at Kawaguchiko by about 13:00\, ski
 p Oishi Park.\n\nSTEP BY STEP:\n- Ride: Fujikyu highway bus 
 (booked): Tokyo Station Yaesu South 09:50 → Kawaguchiko Stat
 ion 11:52 (122 min · ¥2\,300). Booked. Fuji-Q 11:40 and Mt F
 uji Station 11:47 are the stops before.\n- Walk: Bus stop at
  the station forecourt → Coin lockers at Kawaguchiko Station
  (2 min · ≈100 m) [estimate]. About ¥700 a locker (est.). On
 e suitcase each goes in the bus trunk: queue first.\n\nFull 
 plan\, maps and live changes: https://japan-trip-app-wine.ve
 rcel.app/
LOCATION:Kawaguchiko Station
