BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-fri-oishi-1@jp-trip
SEQUENCE:21891
DTSTAMP:20261116T045100Z
DTSTART:20261120T031500Z
DTEND:20261120T034200Z
SUMMARY:Bus: Red Line bus 12:15 → stop 20\, 12:42
DESCRIPTION:ARRIVE 12:42: Oishi Park: Mt Fuji across the lak
 e\, and a quick lunch\nLEAVE 12:15. Red Line bus 12:15 → sto
 p 20\, 12:42 (¥570 each)\n\nAt Kawaguchiko Station first: su
 itcases into the coin lockers (they stay until about 20:06) 
 and buy lunch at the Seven-Eleven by the station. Red Line: 
 tap Suica. Quick lunch at Oishi Park. Be back at stop 20 by 
 13:40.\n\nROUTE: Red Line (河口湖周遊バス レッドライン) from the forecour
 t of Kawaguchiko Station at 12:15 (every 15 min: :00 :15 :30
  :45\; 12:00 if the bus was on time\, 12:30 if it was late)\
 ; tap Suica. It runs round the north shore past the Momiji C
 orridor (stop 17) to the last stop\, stop 20\, 河口湖自然生活館 (Ois
 hi Park)\, 12:42. The Momiji festival makes these buses busy
  in mid-November: if one is full\, take the next. Sit on the
  left for the lake. Lunch here\, quickly (see the picks)\, t
 hen walk the lakeside flower path and have the blueberry sof
 t cream. Be back at stop 20 by 13:40.\n\nSTEP BY STEP:\n- Wa
 lk: Coin lockers → Red Line stop at the station forecourt (1
  min · ≈50 m) [estimate]\n- Ride: Red Line bus (河口湖周遊バス レッドラ
 イン): Kawaguchiko Station 12:15 → stop 20 河口湖自然生活館 (Oishi Par
 k) 12:42 (27 min · ¥570). Every 15 min (:00 :15 :30 :45). Ta
 p Suica.\n- Walk: Stop 20 → Oishi Park lakeside viewpoint (3
  min · ≈200 m) [estimate]. The stop is beside the Natural Li
 ving Center\, at the park.\n\nFull plan\, maps and live chan
 ges: https://japan-trip-app-wine.vercel.app/
LOCATION:Oishi Park Kawaguchiko
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Bus: Red Line bus 12:15 → stop 20\, 12:42
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
