SUMMARY:Bus: Red Line bus 13:42 Oishi Park → Kawaguchiko Sta
 tion 14:09
DESCRIPTION:ARRIVE 14:09: Kawaguchiko Station: change to the
  Fujikyu Line\, 14:25 (bags stay in the lockers)\nLEAVE 13:4
 2. Red Line bus 13:42 Oishi Park → Kawaguchiko Station 14:09
  (¥570 each)\n\nRed Line 13:42 back to the station\, tap Sui
 ca. If you miss it: the 13:57\, then the 14:58 or 15:16 trai
 n.\n\nROUTE: Red Line for 河口湖駅 from stop 20\, 河口湖自然生活館 at 13
 :42\, 27 min to Kawaguchiko Station. Then straight to the Fu
 jikyu Line platform for the 14:25 local (16 min to change\; 
 toilets in the station). The suitcases stay in the lockers u
 ntil you come back at about 20:06. If this bus is late or fu
 ll\, take the 13:57: it reaches the station 14:24\, too late
  for the 14:25\, so take the 14:58 Fuji Kaiyu (limited-expre
 ss ticket needed) or the 15:16 local\, both still before sun
 set.\n\nSTEP BY STEP:\n- Walk: Oishi Park viewpoint → Stop 2
 0 河口湖自然生活館 (3 min · ≈200 m) [estimate]. Be at the stop by 13
 :40 for the 13:42 bus.\n- Ride: Red Line bus: stop 20 13:42 
 → Kawaguchiko Station 14:09 (27 min · ¥570). Tap Suica.\n- W
 alk: Red Line stop\, station forecourt → Fujikyu Line ticket
  gate (2 min · ≈100 m) [estimate]. The bags stay in the lock
 ers until about 20:06.\n\nFull plan\, maps and live changes:
  https://japan-trip-app-wine.vercel.app/
LOCATION:Kawaguchiko Station
