BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-fri-chureito-1@jp-trip
SEQUENCE:21891
DTSTAMP:20261116T045100Z
DTSTART:20261120T050900Z
DTEND:20261120T061000Z
SUMMARY:! Train: Fujikyu Line 14:25 → Shimoyoshida ~14:39\, 
 then walk and 398 steps
DESCRIPTION:ARRIVE 15:10: Chureito Pagoda: up early\, stay u
 ntil sunset (16:33)\nLEAVE 14:09. Fujikyu Line 14:25 → Shimo
 yoshida ~14:39\, then walk and 398 steps (¥305 each)\n\nFuji
 kyu Line 14:25 to Shimoyoshida: tap Suica. Sunset 16:33\, de
 ck about 15:10. Fallbacks: 14:58 Fuji Kaiyu (all seats reser
 ved: buy a limited-express ticket at the Kawaguchiko window 
 before boarding) or the 15:16 local. The 15:56 is after suns
 et.\n\nROUTE: Fujikyu Line (富士急行線) local from Kawaguchiko to
 ward 大月 Otsuki at 14:25\, to 下吉田 Shimoyoshida\, about 14:39\
 ; tap Suica. (Fallbacks if late: the 14:58 Fuji Kaiyu limite
 d express\, which needs a limited-express ticket\, or the 15
 :16 local\; the 15:56 is after sunset.) Follow the signs to 
 新倉山浅間公園 (Arakurayama Sengen Park)\, about 20 min on foot\, t
 hen 398 steps up to the deck above the pagoda. You reach the
  deck about 15:10\, more than an hour before sunset: take th
 e climb slowly\, keep a spot on the deck\, visit Arakura Fuj
 i Sengen Shrine at the foot of the steps. At 16:33 the sun s
 ets to the right of Mt Fuji\, turning the pagoda and the mou
 ntain to silhouettes.\n\nSTEP BY STEP:\n- Wait: Wait at Kawa
 guchiko Station platform (~14 min) [estimate]. Train at 14:2
 5. Fallbacks: 14:58 (Fuji Kaiyu\, limited-express ticket) an
 d 15:16\; the 15:56 is after sunset.\n- Ride: Fujikyu Line l
 ocal toward 大月 Otsuki: Kawaguchiko 14:25 → Shimoyoshida ~14:
 39\, 4 stops (via Fuji-Q Highland\, Fujisan\, Gekkoji) (14 m
 in · ¥305). Tap Suica.\n- Walk: Shimoyoshida Station → Araku
 ra Fuji Sengen Shrine (foot of the 398 steps) (10–25 min · ≈
 700–1\,700 m). Guides give 10-25 min (10\, 15\, 21\, 25)\; t
 he app keeps 20. Metres from 20 min x 70.\n- Walk: Foot of t
 he steps → Viewing deck (10–20 min · ≈200 m). 398 steps\, ab
 out 200 m of path\; guides say 10-15 min\, the place card sa
 ys 15-20. Total reaches the deck about 15:10-15:20: sunset i
 s 16:33\, so more than an hour to spare.\n\nFull plan\, maps
  and live changes: https://japan-trip-app-wine.vercel.app/
LOCATION:Chureito Pagoda Arakurayama Sengen Park
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:! Train: Fujikyu Line 14:25 → Shimoyoshida ~14:3
 9\, then walk and 398 steps
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
