BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-fri-chureito-2@jp-trip
SEQUENCE:21891
DTSTAMP:20261116T045100Z
DTSTART:20261120T074000Z
DTEND:20261120T081000Z
SUMMARY:Walk: Walk down from the park to Honcho Street (abou
 t 30 min)
DESCRIPTION:ARRIVE 17:10: Honcho Street at dusk: Mt Fuji ove
 r the old street\nLEAVE 16:40. Walk down from the park to Ho
 ncho Street (about 30 min)\n\nLeave the deck about 16:40. Us
 e a phone torch on the steps.\n\nROUTE: Leave the deck by ab
 out 16:40 and walk back down (about 7 min down the steps\, 1
 0–15 min to Shimoyoshida Station\, about 10 min on to Honcho
  Street) towards Shimoyoshida Station\, cross the tracks and
  continue to 本町通り (Honcho Street)\; the photo spot is the 本町
 二丁目 (Honcho 2-chome) crossing\, looking south along the stre
 et\, with Mt Fuji dark against the evening sky and the shop 
 signs lit. Stay on the pavement. Walking time is an estimate
 .\n\nSTEP BY STEP:\n- Walk: Viewing deck → Foot of the 398 s
 teps (7 min · ≈200 m) [estimate]. Going down is quicker than
  the 10-15 min climb. Use a phone torch.\n- Walk: Foot of th
 e steps → Shimoyoshida Station (cross the tracks) (10–15 min
  · ≈900 m). Same walk as the afternoon\, 10-15 min.\n- Walk:
  Shimoyoshida Station → Honcho 2-chome crossing (photo spot)
  (10 min · ≈700 m). The place card says about 10 min (est.).
 \n\nFull plan\, maps and live changes: https://japan-trip-ap
 p-wine.vercel.app/
LOCATION:Chureito Pagoda Arakurayama Sengen Park
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Walk: Walk down from the park to Honcho Street (
 about 30 min)
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-fri-chureito-3@jp-trip
SEQUENCE:21891
DTSTAMP:20261116T045100Z
DTSTART:20261120T083000Z
DTEND:20261120T084500Z
SUMMARY:Walk: Walk to Nishiura (Shinsekai Kanpai-dori)
DESCRIPTION:ARRIVE 17:45: Dinner in the Nishiura area: pick 
 an izakaya or yakitori bar by Gekkoji\nLEAVE 17:30. Walk to 
 Nishiura (Shinsekai Kanpai-dori)\n\nROUTE: Walk north from H
 oncho Street towards 月江寺 Gekkoji Station: the old Nishiura (
 西裏) nightlife quarter\, with the restored 新世界乾杯通り (Shinsekai
  Kanpai-dori) lane and small izakaya and yakitori bars on th
 e streets around it. Nishiura is an area\, not one restauran
 t: walk the lanes and pick a place. Places are small: split 
 into two groups of three\, or ask one place to seat six. Ope
 ning days are not checked: have a second choice.\n\nSTEP BY 
 STEP:\n- Walk: Honcho 2-chome crossing → Nishiura / Shinseka
 i Kanpai-dori (10–15 min · ≈1\,000 m). The place card says 1
 0-15 min (est.). Walk north towards 月江寺 Gekkoji Station.\n\n
 Full plan\, maps and live changes: https://japan-trip-app-wi
 ne.vercel.app/
LOCATION:Shinsekai Kanpai Dori Fujiyoshida
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Walk: Walk to Nishiura (Shinsekai Kanpai-dori)
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
