SUMMARY:Train: Fujikyu Line 19:53 Shimoyoshida → Kawaguchiko
  ~20:06
DESCRIPTION:ARRIVE 20:06: Back to Kawaguchiko: check in at F
 uga A\nLEAVE 19:53. Fujikyu Line 19:53 Shimoyoshida → Kawagu
 chiko ~20:06 (¥305 each)\n\nFujikyu 19:53 from Shimoyoshida\
 , tap Suica (later: 20:23\, 20:52\, 21:34\, last 23:51). Col
 lect the suitcases from the lockers\, then Fuga A\, 2 min on
  foot (contactless check-in).\n\nROUTE: Fujikyu Line for 河口湖
  Kawaguchiko from Gekkoji (about 19:55\, est.) or Shimoyoshi
 da (19:53)\; trains also at 19:22\, 20:23\, 20:52\, 21:34\, 
 the last at 23:51 from Shimoyoshida. Tap Suica. Check in at 
 Fuga A (contactless\, 2 min on foot\; collect the suitcases 
 from the station lockers first if you left them there)\, ear
 ly night: the sunrise taxi is at 05:45.\n\nSTEP BY STEP:\n- 
 Walk: Nishiura restaurant → Gekkoji Station (5 min · ≈350 m)
  [estimate]. Leave the restaurant by 19:45. Gekkoji is the s
 top after Shimoyoshida (about 19:55\, est.).\n- Wait: Wait a
 t Gekkoji Station (~10 min) [estimate]. Train about 19:55 (e
 st.)\; Shimoyoshida 19:53 is the stop before.\n- Ride: Fujik
 yu Line toward 河口湖 Kawaguchiko: Gekkoji ~19:55 (Shimoyoshida
  19:53) → Kawaguchiko ~20:06\, 3 stops (via Fujisan\, Fuji-Q
  Highland) (11 min · ¥305). Later trains: 20:23\, 20:52\, 21
 :34\, last 23:51 from Shimoyoshida. Tap Suica.\n- Walk: Kawa
 guchiko Station → Fuga A (contactless check-in) (2 min · ≈15
 0 m)\n\nFull plan\, maps and live changes: https://japan-tri
 p-app-wine.vercel.app/
LOCATION:Kawaguchiko Station
