BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-sat-kogamasao-1@jp-trip
SEQUENCE:21891
DTSTAMP:20261116T045100Z
DTSTART:20261120T204500Z
DTEND:20261120T210000Z
SUMMARY:! Taxi: Pre-booked taxi from Fuga A
DESCRIPTION:ARRIVE 06:00: Sunrise over Mt Fuji at Kogamasao 
 Memorial Park\nLEAVE 05:45. Pre-booked taxi from Fuga A (¥80
 0 each)\n\nTAXI (book ahead\, confirm the night before): 05:
 45 from Fuga A\, 2 cars or one jumbo taxi for 6\; pay the dr
 iver. No bus runs before 9:00. Sunrise about 06:25. Wear the
  warm layers: near freezing.\n\nROUTE: No bus runs before 9:
 00. On Friday book a taxi for 05:45 at Fuga A: one 6-seat ca
 r if the company has one\, otherwise two taxis. Show the dri
 ver: 古賀政男記念公園 (富士河口湖町河口). About 10–15 min and roughly ¥2\,00
 0–2\,500 per car (est.). Also book the pick-up at the Momiji
  Corridor for 07:30. Sunrise is about 06:25\; the summit tur
 ns pink a few minutes before.\n\nSTEP BY STEP:\n- Taxi: Fuga
  A → 古賀政男記念公園 Kogamasao Memorial Park (show the driver the J
 apanese name) (15 min · ≈3.5 km · ¥800 pp) [estimate]. About
  2.8 km straight line\, about 3.5 km by road (x1.25)\; 10-15
  min. Fare ¥800 a person\, est.\n\nTODAY'S FIXED POINTS:\n- 
 Taxis 05:45 and 07:30 (to book). The app does not record the
 m as booked.\n- Sunrise about 06:25. At the park by 06:00: 2
 5 min to spare.\n- Bus 08:40 (booked). Out of Fuga A by 08:2
 5\, at stop 3 by 08:30. The taxi back at 07:30 gets you to F
 uga A at 07:45: 40 min for breakfast\, packing and check-out
 .\n- Sagawa hand-in by 11:00 (same-day delivery to Grids). T
 he bus arrives 10:25: 35 min to spare\, with 20 min planned 
 at Busta Shinjuku.\n- Shibuya Sky\, if you book it: slot abo
 ut 15:40\, sunset about 16:30\, off the deck at about 17:10 
 for Minamillumi at 17:35 (fully dark from about 17:30). Toky
 o Metropolitan Government light show\, 18:30: in the Novembe
 r table (shows every 30 min\, 17:30–21:30)\; the timetable f
 rom 20 Nov is not confirmed.\nIF RUNNING LATE:\n- Sunrise ru
 ns long: still take the 07:30 taxi back. Skip the Momiji Cor
 ridor (about 35 min) before you skip the bus.\n- The bus rea
 ches Busta after 10:45: skip Sagawa. Use storage at the same
  counter or coin lockers (about ¥800–1\,500 a bag\, est.) an
 d collect the bags on the way back through Shinjuku before 2
 1:00.\n- Tokyo afternoon\, first to shrink: Shibuya Crossing
  and free time (85 min)\, then Icho Namiki (45 min)\, then M
 eiji Jingu and Harajuku (90 min).\n- Evening: Minamillumi (4
 0 min) can be cut to 20. Nothing after the light show is fix
 ed: the Kabukicho stroll\, Don Quijote (40 min) and dessert 
 (38 min) are the end-of-day shock absorber. Leave Shinjuku b
 y about 22:10 to reach Grids before check-in closes at 23:00
  (the last JR train time is not checked).\n\nFull plan\, map
 s and live changes: https://japan-trip-app-wine.vercel.app/
