 en runs up the Chuo Expressway. Arrive Busta Shinjuku 10:25\
 , at the 3rd-floor arrival deck (新宿駅南口・3階おりば). Booked: ₫1\,9
 55\,532 for 6\, ¥2\,000 each. Direct\, no changes\, suitcase
 s go in the hold. The next bus is 09:10 → 10:55 (not booked)
 \n\nSTEP BY STEP:\n- Walk: Fuga A (suitcases) → Kawaguchiko 
