SUMMARY:! Train: Sagawa counter\, then JR Yamanote Line to H
 arajuku
DESCRIPTION:ARRIVE 11:10: Meiji Jingu + Harajuku lunch\nLEAV
 E 10:45. Sagawa counter\, then JR Yamanote Line to Harajuku 
 (¥160 each)\n\nSagawa deadline 11:00. Then JR Yamanote Line 
 from platform 14 to Harajuku\, tap Suica.\n\nROUTE: On the 3
 rd floor of Busta Shinjuku\, where the bus arrives\, go into
  the Tokyo Tourist Information Center: the Sagawa counter (6
 :30–21:00) sends suitcases to a Tokyo hotel the same day if 
 you hand them in by 11:00\; they reach Grids Tokyo Ueno afte
 r 16:00 (about ¥2\,180 for a suitcase up to 140 cm and 20 kg
 \; counted in the budget). If you would rather not send them
 \, or the bus is late and you miss 11:00\, leave them in sto
 rage at the same counter (about ¥800–1\,500 a bag for the da
 y) or in coin lockers\, and collect them on the way back thr
 ough Shinjuku before 21:00 (then JR to Ueno with the suitcas
 es). Then go down to the JR gates below the terminal: JR Yam
 anote Line\, platform 14\, toward 渋谷・品川 (Shibuya / Shinagawa
 )\, 2 stops to Harajuku JY19\, ~4 min.\n\nSTEP BY STEP:\n- W
 alk: Sagawa counter (3F\, Tokyo Tourist Information Center) 
 → JR Shinjuku New South Gate (新南改札) (2 min · ≈150 m). Busta 
 connects to the New South Gate in about 2 min (several guide
 s). Hand in suitcases by 11:00.\n- Walk: New South Gate → Ya
 manote platform 14 (toward 渋谷・品川) (3 min · ≈200 m) [estimate
 ]. Platform 14 is from the app.\n- Wait: Wait at Shinjuku pl
 atform 14 (~3 min) [estimate]\n- Ride: JR Yamanote Line towa
 rd 渋谷・品川 (Shibuya / Shinagawa): Shinjuku JY17 → Harajuku JY1
 9\, 2 stops (via Yoyogi JY18) (4 min · ¥160)\n- Walk: Haraju
 ku Station → Meiji Jingu south entrance (first torii) (2 min
  · ≈100 m) [estimate]. The shrine entrance is beside the sta
 tion.\n- Note: These steps add up to about 14 min\; the sche
 dule keeps 25 (10:45 to 11:10)\, so 11 min are spare for the
  Sagawa queue and toilets.\n\nFull plan\, maps and live chan
 ges: https://japan-trip-app-wine.vercel.app/
