  Omotesando G02 to Gaienmae G03 (1 stop\, ¥180).\n\nSTEP BY 
 STEP:\n- Walk: Harajuku Station / Jingu-mae crossing → Omote
 sando Station (Aoyama-dori crossing)\, down Omotesando (15 m
