 alk: Omotesando crossing → Gaienmae Station\, along Aoyama-d
 ori (10 min · ≈750 m) [estimate]. About 0.75 km straight lin
 e.\n- Walk: Gaienmae Station (Exit 2a) → Start of Icho Namik
 i (5 min · ≈320 m). Official Minato City walking map: about 
 320 m\, about 5 min.\n- Note: Total about 2.2 km\, about 30 
 min on foot. Faster: Ginza Line Omotesando G02 → Gaienmae G0
 3\, 1 stop\, about 2 min\, ¥180\, saves about 10 min of walk
 ing.\n\nFull plan\, maps and live changes: https://japan-tri
 p-app-wine.vercel.app/
