 ya JY20 → Shinjuku JY17\, 3 stops (via Harajuku JY19\, Yoyog
 i JY18) (7 min · ¥170). Guides say about 6 min on the train.
 \n- Walk: Shinjuku platform → South Exit (南口)\, then Minamil
 lumi (5 min · ≈350 m) [estimate]\n- Note: Total about 23 min
  (the old plan said 17). Leave the Sky by about 17:10\, afte
 r the city lights come on.\n\nFull plan\, maps and live chan
