 .\n\nROUTE: Walk back along Shinjuku-dori to the East Exit (
 東口) of JR Shinjuku (about 7 min\, est.)\; on the plaza\, loo
 k up at the 3D cat on Cross Shinjuku Vision (it plays at :00
 \, :15\, :30 and :45). JR Yamanote Line from platform 15\, t
 oward 池袋・上野 (Ikebukuro / Ueno): Shinjuku JY17 → Ueno JY05\, 
 ~25 min. Leave Ueno by the Iriya Exit (入谷口)\, 2 min to Grids
 . Check-in closes at 23:00.\n\nSTEP BY STEP:\n- Walk: Shinju
 ku-dori / Shinjuku Sanchome → JR Shinjuku East Exit plaza (東
 口) (5–8 min · ≈500 m) [estimate]. Walk back along Shinjuku-d
