 lk: Asakusa G19\, Exit 1 → Kaminarimon gate (1 min · ≈60 m) 
 [estimate]. Then Nakamise street (about 250 m) to the main h
 all.\n\nTODAY'S FIXED POINTS:\n- Skyliner (not booked). The 
