  by 09:00\, train about 09:20: 20 min to swap\, and the next
  train if the queue is long.\n- Flight VJ935\, 16:25. Bag-dr
 op counters 13:25–15:25\, gate closes about 16:05. Comfortab
 le target: Terminal 2 by 13:00. Last time I would accept: ab
 out 14:00 (estimate: tax-free kiosk\, bag drop and security 
 together take an hour or more).\nIF RUNNING LATE:\n- Senso-j
 i and Azumabashi (80 min\, 07:00–08:20) can be cut short\; l
 eave Asakusa by 08:20 at the latest.\n- The outlet block is 
